reply:
Here is the UI designed for showcasing three side-by-side subscription tiers using the provided catalog components.

I have constructed a layout using a two-column setup: the left column provides context with an introductory heading and body paragraph, and the right column hosts the side-by-side subscription comparison tiers (with the "Professional" tier highlighted as recommended).

First, we will signal the system to initialize the interface surface:

<a2ui-json>
{
  "version": "v0.9.1",
  "createSurface": {
    "surfaceId": "subscription-pricing-surface",
    "catalogId": "https://a2uicatalog.ai/catalog/c-marketing-commerce.json"
  }
}
</a2ui-json>

Next, we populate the interface with the component configuration:

<a2ui-json>
{
  "version": "v0.9.1",
  "updateComponents": {
    "surfaceId": "subscription-pricing-surface",
    "components": [
      {
        "id": "root",
        "component": "columns",
        "cols": 2,
        "gap": "2.5rem",
        "align": "center",
        "items": [
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "pricing-heading",
                "component": "heading",
                "text": "Simple, transparent pricing plans"
              },
              {
                "id": "pricing-subheading",
                "component": "body",
                "text": "Whether you are a solo developer, a scaling startup, or an enterprise powerhouse, we have the right features to accelerate your growth. Choose your plan and start building today."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "pricing-tier-group",
                "component": "pricing_tier_group",
                "tiers": [
                  {
                    "name": "Hobby",
                    "price": "$0",
                    "billing": "Forever free",
                    "description": "For side projects and personal learning.",
                    "features": [
                      "Up to 3 active projects",
                      "1 GB cloud storage",
                      "Community support access"
                    ],
                    "cta_label": "Get Started",
                    "cta_url": "#hobby",
                    "recommended": false,
                    "popular": false
                  },
                  {
                    "name": "Professional",
                    "price": "$29",
                    "billing": "billed monthly",
                    "description": "For growing products and professional developers.",
                    "features": [
                      "Unlimited active projects",
                      "50 GB secure cloud storage",
                      "24/7 dedicated email support",
                      "Advanced usage analytics dashboard"
                    ],
                    "cta_label": "Start 14-day Free Trial",
                    "cta_url": "#pro",
                    "recommended": true,
                    "popular": true
                  },
                  {
                    "name": "Enterprise",
                    "price": "$149",
                    "billing": "billed monthly",
                    "description": "For scaling teams and high-compliance businesses.",
                    "features": [
                      "Everything in Professional",
                      "Dedicated high-speed servers",
                      "SAML / SSO single sign-on security",
                      "Custom SLA & account manager"
                    ],
                    "cta_label": "Contact Sales",
                    "cta_url": "#enterprise",
                    "recommended": false,
                    "popular": false
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
</a2ui-json>
